# ZineROM Engine (Fork)

> **Notice:** This repository is a custom **fork** of the original QuantumRom Tool, which has reached **End of Life (EOL)**. 

## Overview
This tool was forked to continue maintenance, apply heavy modifications, and introduce various system-level enhancements. 

* **Status:** This workflow and repository are now **Public**.
* **Modifications:** Extensive changes have been applied to scripts, environment settings, and build routines.
* **Current Issue:** Please note that the tool currently contains unresolved errors/bugs that are not being actively fixed at this moment.

## Forking & Contributions
You are free to **fork this repository**, modify the code, and fix any existing issues or adapt the workflow to your needs. 

Feel free to submit a Pull Request if you manage to patch the known issues!
